  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conditional Loan given to Swedfund for their investment in the fund Central america fund limited. Swedfund holds shares to the value of USD 3 000 000. Repayment to Sida depends on the return on shares or if the fund will sell of ther investments.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Villkorsl&#xe5;n via Swedfund f&#xf6;r vidare investering ett venture capital bolag CAIF (central america fund limited) f&#xf6;r investering i  centralamerikanska l&#xe4;nder. Swedfund har aktier till ett v&#xe4;rde av USD 3 000 000. &#xc5;terbetalning till sida n&#xe4;r utdelning eller avveckling sker i fonden.</narrative>
  </description>
